&lt;strong&gt;6:00 p.m.&lt;/strong&gt; Program begins with opening remarks, followed by a moderated dialogue&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;7:00 p.m.&lt;/strong&gt; Program concludes&lt;/p&gt;
