&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://climatepromise.undp.org/what-we-do/our-team/cassie-flynn" target="_blank"&gt;Cassie Flynn&lt;/a&gt;, Global Director of Climate Change,&amp;nbsp;United Nations Development Programme (UNDP)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://akshatrathi.com/book/"&gt;Akshat Rathi&lt;/a&gt;, Senior Reporter, Bloomberg&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://history.columbia.edu/person/adam-tooze/"&gt;Adam Tooze&lt;/a&gt;, Kathryn and Shelby Cullom Davis Professor of History, Columbia University&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.climate.columbia.edu/leadership"&gt;Alexis Abramson&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;(moderator), Dean and Professor of Climate, Columbia Climate School&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Climate School Students, please email mdm2271@columbia for information on reserved tickets for students&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Manifest community at University Life&amp;rsquo;s second &lt;strong&gt;Find a Friend&lt;/strong&gt; event!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manifestors &amp;amp; Mystics is the second event in the Find a Friend series and a laid-back gathering for anyone interested in all things mystical. If tarot, astrology, crystals, reiki, aura reading, or other forms of mystical exploration spark your interest, come connect with others who share these interests and make new friends.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This gathering encourages meaningful connections through hands-on activities and prompts to spark conversation. Attendees can engage in intentional sharing, explore books on astrology and other mystical interests, design their own tarot card, read tarot for themselves or others, make a crystal intention bag, and connect with other students around shared curiosities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Just bring an interest in the metaphysical, spiritual, cosmic, energetic, or divine &amp;mdash; and connect with others who share your curiosity.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All students are welcome. Entry is available on a first-come, first-served basis, while supplies last and until we reach capacity.&lt;/p&gt;
