&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Jessica Stern-&amp;nbsp; Former U.S. Special Envoy to Advance the Human Rights of LGBTQI+ Persons, Co-Founder and Co-President of the Alliance for Diplomacy and Justice, an organization co-founded by eight former ambassadors and envoys to center human rights within U.S. foreign policy&lt;/p&gt;
