&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ircpl.columbia.edu/calendar/between-faith-and-fiction-theologians-as-translators-in-the-jewish-enlightenment" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Between Faith and Fiction: Theologians as Translators in the Jewish Enlightenment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.ircpl.columbia.edu/" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Institute for Religion, Culture&amp;nbsp;and Public Life&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Tuesday, March 24, 12:30-2:00pm&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Casa Hisp&amp;aacute;nica (612 West 116th Street)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Series:&lt;/strong&gt; Devotion and Distraction&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speaker:&lt;/strong&gt; Lital Levy (Princeton University)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Respondent:&lt;/strong&gt; Seth Kimmel (Columbia University)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In a simple story that we now tell ourselves about secularization, the European Enlightenment plays a key role: It&amp;rsquo;s the period when scientific inquiry and rational thought became ascendent, while religious practice receded to a more limited private sphere, a shift that coincided with new paradigms of toleration and liberty. The truth is of course more complicated, as theologians from various religious communities reimagined both religious practice and belief in dialogue with the philosophical and political trends of the moment. Along with their neighbors from other religious communities, how did participants in the Jewish Enlightenment, or Haskalah, come to view the new distractions, technological transformations, and dream of universal knowledge that characterized modern life before the eighteenth and nineteenth centuries?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Free and open to the public &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdaaDEcYwMgicdSVKlaPmkk-_4lSW8rws30ad_QrccDqWTWuQ/viewform" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Registration is required&amp;mdash;Please register in advance to reserve your spot&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
